<title>USA: BAB Holdings plans 8 stores in Indiana.</title>
<headline>BAB Holdings plans 8 stores in Indiana.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BAB Holdings Inc said Wednesday it planned to open eight Big Apple Bagels stores in Indiana during the next three years.</p>
<p>The stores will be in Indianapolis and central Indiana.</p>
<p>&quot;This opens up an important new market and strengthens our development in the Midwest,&quot; Michael Evans, president and CEO of BAB Holdings, said in a statement.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
